                      (    forth6809.asm):07637                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):07638                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07639                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07640                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07641                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07642                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07643                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07644                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07645                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07646                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07647                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07648                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):07649                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):07650                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07651                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07652                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):07653                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):07654                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):07655                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
